{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106837","id":2544676521,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6XrK6p","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106837","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106837.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106837.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106837","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106837/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106837/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106837/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/faddd60c40e0842a140c3243bf0ba4fa7a5a85f2","number":106837,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add unique Node IDs to support base and instantiated scene refactorings","user":{"login":"reduz","id":6265307,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNjUzMDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6265307?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reduz","html_url":"https://github.com/reduz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reduz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reduz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reduz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reduz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reduz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reduz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reduz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reduz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reduz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The main goal of this PR is to safeguard when a base or instantiated scene changes (nodes renamed, moved or readded), that the hierarchy is still maintained and the node can be found.\r\n\r\nSupersedes #86960.\r\n\r\nWhat it does:\r\n* Implements unique node IDs.\r\n* These IDs act as a fallback to names when saving.\r\n* The IDs are **USED AS A FALLBACK**, so they are just an addition. It should not break any current existing scene.\r\n* If a scene renames or moves a node, inherited or instantiated scenes will no longer lose reference to it.\r\n* This should also eventually allow for 3D asset importing that supports unique IDs to keep references in case of scene inheritance used.\r\n\r\nUnlike the previous approach, this one is intended to be a fallback, only used if the node is not found. This makes it safer to implement and ensure that, at worst case, we fail to find the node, but nothing breaks.\r\n\r\n*Bugsquad edit:*\r\n- Fixes #19520\r\n- Fixes #41047\r\n- Fixes #82700\r\n- Fixes #84928\r\n- Fixes #97576\r\n- Fixes #100038\r\n- Fixes #110518\r\n- And fixes a handful of closes bug reports and proposals for the same issue\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/6291","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/mil